        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Spinach",
        "text_sha256": "115848bd1b625cfe983273f195922a7553f0a63022873a97c8c9966d1cbcad47",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Squash",
        "text_sha256": "9f9a8456f0eef1e4d02d9d00874d9bb6cc62b7c480b291dedf9d0afeac80b47b",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Sweet potatoes",
        "text_sha256": "a300e12a8cd54d999849f8bc965c18fa981b8b779193fdc6f96e9cadc7832df6",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How to incorporate fiber into your toddler’s diet",
        "text_sha256": "bbe97328907ae8906aedb295b320867976c21ceb6ffbb210936ca7d38a1dc232",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "One of the best ways to interest your toddler in healthy foods of any kind is to involve her in the preparation and cooking processes. Try asking your little sous chef to wash the vegetables or sprinkle berries into pancake or muffin mixes (if she's able), or to arrange the foods into “food art” on the serving plates.",
        "text_sha256": "97a712bdb06f7ee6d1ec0aaf66982db17049f330a90c551bd37f40d3bbc10078",
        "word_count": 58
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here are some smart and easy ways to fit fiber into your toddler’s diet:",
        "text_sha256": "62f5aa079840428416a35e80942411bc9eca440d037daf9bed5cf510448a566b",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Use whole grains instead of refined grains when making toast, sandwiches, wraps or burritos.",
        "text_sha256": "843a02bc7d3ea9b7fc30fbdbe7356b980eb58fdc7b82fb31364ea8ea9b25b1be",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Serve up cereals that list whole wheat or oats at the top of the ingredient list. (The cereal should also contain at least 3 grams of fiber per serving.)",
        "text_sha256": "e88aaf4a30fad42f50405bf25fee895f2566a5ccd5fd32e5b56069557dac1a87",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Add colorful berries to yogurts, or blend them into pancakes and muffins.",
        "text_sha256": "8a7ae94bfad3b8eb34696de5bbe07939f8927843e5a095b7356b7458dbe1d80a",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Make whole grain waffles and pancakes, which have more fiber than the regular kind. You can buy whole-grain frozen waffles and pancakes at the supermarket, or make your own using a whole-grain or buckwheat mix.",
        "text_sha256": "c03094703151f06fc5fe21627d0ae5dda980f5037afec2ac04f70b8e29d48e73",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Add beans and lentils to soups, stews and wraps. Or, purée them into homemade hummus.",
        "text_sha256": "4eda2dfed0703e86374ab10c97c3c9c1bee112be5c149a30c8cf9aba60bc4954",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000044",
        "block_index": 44,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Serve fiber-filled brown or wild rice instead of white. And for an extra fiber punch, mix in veggies or beans, like navy, pinto or black.",
        "text_sha256": "1d4e0509de9a443e8b10bdead0d15fa2fe135dab4d5a96044244e6a1261f0500",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Blend spinach into smoothies or mix it into muffins, pancakes and egg dishes.",
        "text_sha256": "74293e8e6207f899076bb83cb3c84cac3ac5cac9ec3cb3ec9fa7d41897065acb",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000046",
        "block_index": 46,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Choose pasta that’s made of whole wheat, spelt or quinoa. Then toss some veggies into the sauce for a fiber-rich dinner.",
        "text_sha256": "cd8733e4703fac6c076ef653ff6e6fa2685108bd9f426a7ead5642a12de1c817",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000047",
        "block_index": 47,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Mix bran into burgers, meatballs or meat loaf.",
        "text_sha256": "1b30f17a145b04dca2679bb47233185fd86c6c8fe45b02e90513d5443bb530a0",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000048",
        "block_index": 48,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Blend avocado into smoothies or soups, or use in place of saturated fats in baked goods.",
        "text_sha256": "cf8cbb68ef9413351a052efbc91292c7725cc6a9a8053ab86cf4750d671e934b",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000049",
        "block_index": 49,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Whip up yogurt smoothies with berries and some bran.",
        "text_sha256": "3bfe84f10c6f421f740b5863e8bfbfac254dc42c98efc1f6654bb2a8d6ad86e7",
        "word_count": 9
      }
